<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Handling medical consultations and treatment planning</li>
</ul>

<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>  Supervision of Panchakarma procedures</li>
</ul>

<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>  Managing overall clinical operations</li>
</ul>

<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>  Coordinating administrative responsibilities </li>
</ul>

<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li> Monitoring patient care and treatment protocols</li>
</ul>

